{
  "text": "Pursuant to Article 6 of the General Data Protection Regulation (Regulation (EU) 2016\/679), the Data Controller, Meridian Health GmbH, may process Personal Data only where a lawful basis exists. The Berlin Regional Court fined the company EUR 1,200,000 on 3 February 2023 for transferring records to a Processor located in the United States without adequate safeguards under Chapter V.",
